    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that they all have different goals, but if i'm being honest with my constituents, i can't just give them a list of pros and cons. i need a recommendation. if we want to actually fix the systemic inequality issues in this city, which of these is the objectively most equitable choice?",
